{"code":"004840","name":"DRB동일","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"화학","sector_desc":"석유화학·정밀화학·2차전지 소재 등. 유가, 중국 수요, 스프레드(제품가−원료가)가 실적을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 1945년 동일화학공업소로 창업, 1976년 기업공개, 2022년 물적분할을 통해 순수지주회사로 전환함. 연결대상 18개사로 종합고무부품(비히클실링, 토목건축자재, 면진제진시스템), 산업용고무제품(전동벨트, 컨베어벨트, 러버트랙), 자동화 솔루션 및 의료기기 부문으로 구성됨. 그룹 경영전략 수립 효율화와 ESG경영 실천, 친환경차 대응 실링·경량화 기술 강화, 자동화산업 및 디지털 헬스케어 분야 확장을 추진하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-19","n_days":298,"close":3930.0,"open":3875.0,"high":3975.0,"low":3875.0,"volume":13310,"amount":52308300.0,"ret_1d":-0.2538,"gap":-1.6497,"range_pct":2.5445,"ret_5":1.4194,"ret_20":-2.963,"ret_60":-6.872,"ret_120":-28.6751,"ret_250":-20.9256,"ma20":3959.5,"ma60":4166.0,"ma120":4398.5,"ma200":4793.775,"close_vs_ma200":-18.0187,"close_vs_ma60":-5.6649,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-43.4641,"r2_60":0.7437,"slope_120":-42.0,"r2_120":0.6833,"slope_250":-20.9658,"r2_250":0.331,"high52":6470.0,"low52":3750.0,"pos_52w":6.6176,"dd_52w":-39.2581,"mdd_1y":-38.16,"atr14_pct":2.6627,"vol_ann_60":24.9338,"vol_avg20":25673.15,"vol_ratio20":0.5184,"vr5":0.977,"vr20":0.803,"amount_avg5":95370744.0,"amount_avg20":101443084.25,"amount_avg60":109829224.9167,"obv_chg20":-36.9209,"turnover_20":2.6642,"pv_eff_20":-1.1121,"rsi14":42.9959,"frgn_net_5":686.0,"inst_net_5":950.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0036,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0049,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0085,"frgn_net_20":-52111.0,"inst_net_20":-149476.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.2704,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.7756,"smart_net_20_pct":-1.046,"frgn_net_60":-24809.0,"inst_net_60":-247319.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.1287,"inst_net_60_pct":-1.2833,"smart_net_60_pct":-1.412,"frgn_net_120":-112763.0,"inst_net_120":-307789.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.5851,"inst_net_120_pct":-1.597,"smart_net_120_pct":-2.1822,"foreign_ratio":1.11,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.17,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":112.0,"op_margin_q":5.1259,"op_qoq":89.8305,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":154.5455,"rev_yoy":6.4296,"op_trend_4q":-2.6994,"fin_period":"202606","roe":2.94,"debt_ratio":8